    <content type="xhtml" xml:base="https://tantek.com/" xml:space="preserve">
      <default:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:space="preserve">faschadenfreude, noun<default:br class="auto-break"/><default:br class="auto-break"/>definition: joy or pleasure from seeing fascists lose, suffer, and experience other misfortunes, especially as consequences, direct and indirect, for their words and actions.  <default:br class="auto-break"/><default:br class="auto-break"/>etymology: portmanteau of 'fascists' and 'schadenfreude'.<default:br class="auto-break"/><default:br class="auto-break"/>see also FAFO.<default:br class="auto-break"/><default:br class="auto-break"/>inspiration: <default:br class="auto-break"/>* <default:a class="auto-link" href="https://www.vanityfair.com/story/midterms-republican-watch-party-blue-wave">https://www.vanityfair.com/story/midterms-republican-watch-party-blue-wave</default:a><default:br class="auto-break"/>* <default:a class="auto-link" href="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/07/flip-voters-trump-midterms">https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/07/flip-voters-trump-midterms</default:a><default:br class="auto-break"/>* <default:a class="auto-link" href="https://theconversation.com/donald-trumps-republicans-suffer-landslide-defeat-what-this-means-for-the-world-295769">https://theconversation.com/donald-trumps-republicans-suffer-landslide-defeat-what-this-means-for-the-world-295769</default:a><default:br class="auto-break"/>* <default:a class="auto-link" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/07/us/turning-point-arizona-midterms.html">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/07/us/turning-point-arizona-midterms.html</default:a><default:br class="auto-break"/>* <default:a class="auto-link" href="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2026/nov/08/trump-midterms-voters-mirror-world">https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2026/nov/08/trump-midterms-voters-mirror-world</default:a><default:br class="auto-break"/>* <default:a class="auto-link" href="https://www.theguardian.com/media/2026/nov/04/fox-news-midterm-ratings">https://www.theguardian.com/media/2026/nov/04/fox-news-midterm-ratings</default:a><default:br class="auto-break"/><default:br class="auto-break"/>#<default:span class="p-category auto-tag">blueWave</default:span> #<default:span class="p-category auto-tag">FAFO</default:span></default:div>
